          "gloss": "flea",
          "definition": "A small biting insect. David uses a single flea as an image of his own insignificance.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "ref": "1Sa.24.15",
              "role": "defining",
              "note": "David calls himself a dead dog and a single flea as he asks whom the king has come out to pursue."
